'''Hunter's Map II''' (狩人の地図ⅠⅠ, ''Karyūdo no Chizu ⅠⅠ'', '''Hunter's Map ⅠⅠ''') is an [[Enigma Stages|Enigma]] map that drops [[Catfruit|Behemoth Stones]]. It has four stages and upon clearing any of them, the map disappears until it is found again. It can only appear at Enigma Levels 4-5; once Level 6 is reached, it is permanently replaced by [[Hunter's Map III]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

